ar Ally: Djinni\">Planar Ally: Djinni</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/40px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/60px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/80px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Planar Ally: Deva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/40px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\">Planar Ally: Deva</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Cambion\" title=\"Planar Ally: Cambion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/40px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/60px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/80px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Planar Ally: Cambion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/40px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Cambion\" title=\"Planar Ally: Cambion\">Planar Ally: Cambion</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 11: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Cambion\" title=\"Planar Ally: Cambion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/20px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/30px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/40px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cambion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp/20px-Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Planar_Ally_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Cambion\" title=\"Planar Ally: Cambion\">Cambion</a> version of this spell is also granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\">Infernal Rapier</a>.</li>\n<li>The Deva version of this spell can also be learned by <a href=\"/wiki/Wizards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wizards\">wizards</a>, or used once, via the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion\" title=\"Scroll of Bestial Communion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Bestial_Communion\" title=\"Scroll of Bestial Communion\">Scroll of Bestial Communion</a>; a single-use scroll that casts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sights_of_the_Seelie:_Summon_Deva\" title=\"Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/25px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/38px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp/50px-Sights_of_the_Seelie_Summon_Deva_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sights of the Seelie: Summon Deva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d